WEBVTT

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:19.200
<i>C'mon, morning's here--time to be on our way</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.700
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.830
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>No turning back: this trip is nonfiction</i>

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:35.080
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>It's now or never, the real deal: Ready, and... action!</i>

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.540
<i>Harsh winds that make us hesitate,</i>
<i>nights spent crying our eyes out</i>

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:45.790
<i>They're not necessarily bad things (not bad)</i>

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:51.500
<i>Just like the power in a spring:</i>
<i>the harder we're pushed</i>

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.040
<i>The higher we can fly</i>

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:05.580
<i>Face the far-off distance</i>
<i>and aim for the horizon: rising sun</i>

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.870
<i>Holding our hands up to that morning sun</i>

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:21.250
<i>Our shared feelings brought us together--</i>
<i>we're not alone anymore</i>

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:27.450
<i>And so we're on this brilliant voyage</i>

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:34.250
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:42.540
I have only five years' grace remaining.

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:45.950
In five years I will be 22.

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:49.330
Wait--so that means...

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:52.870
Yes: my crowning ceremony.

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:58.410
Once I am crowned, I will be recognized
as Chin's ruler both at home and abroad.

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:02.660
When that happens, some in Ryo Shi's faction
are sure to come over to my side.

00:02:04.370 --> 00:02:06.450
Five years is plenty!

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:07.870
Shin?!

00:02:07.870 --> 00:02:10.080
We're not playin' around here.

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:14.950
If they're comin' in five years
to put an end to this, that's when we fight!

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:17.450
Exactly so.

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:20.450
And Shin--what about you?

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:25.250
Can you make general in five short years?

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:30.750
A general... in five years?

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:36.330
The general I mobilize with my
very first command will be you, Shin!

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:57.540
Five more years...

00:02:57.540 --> 00:03:00.290
Even if Ryo Fui does come to crush him,

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:05.120
Sei'll be the undisputed King of Chin.

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:07.330
Which means...

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:08.950
...I'll do it, Sei!

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:11.870
In five years, I'll be a general--bet on it!

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:22.120
"The King and the Ant"

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.870
The Hi Shin Unit!

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:51.410
After the Chin-Sho alliance was complete

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:53.450
and Shin returned to the Hi Shin Unit,

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:57.620
the squadron only continued to grow,
displaying its ferocity on the front lines.

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:12.290
Shou Sa!

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:21.410
So <i>you're</i> the squad that's been
pushin' its luck 'round these parts.

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:22.950
H-He's huge!

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:24.830
Bigger than Ryuu Sen!

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:29.080
Bring your commander out front!
Gou Tan here will send his head into orbit

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.870
with my three-headed mace!

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:38.370
Dammit.

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:56.540
I can't be wastin' time on mooks like you.
I only have five years.

00:04:58.450 --> 00:05:00.700
R-Retreat! Retreat!!

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:16.000
We just keep on winning!
Pretty soon no one will stand up to us!

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:17.660
Hi Shin Unit: the strongest around!

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:22.040
Aren't you full of yourself!
You hardly lift a finger out there.

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:24.540
But boy, can he talk!

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:29.200
Oh, shut up! Why not bask
a little in the afterglow of another victory?

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:32.410
I guess. I mean, look at the big picture here:

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:36.410
Who knows if Bi Hei'll even be alive tomorrow?

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:40.410
Now wait a second!

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:49.120
I am so not gonna die!
I'll come home alive so Tou Bi can love me up!

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:51.410
My sweet Tou Bi...!

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:04.160
Now, is that the face of a victorious commander?

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:13.790
Long time no see, Shin.

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:15.290
Heki!

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:19.660
Talk about a surprise!

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:22.950
To think the Hi Shin Unit
is this famous on the front lines...

00:06:22.950 --> 00:06:25.580
As soon as I heard, I knew you'd be here.

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:27.830
Only 'cause these front lines are tiny.

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:30.080
Doesn't take much to get your name out there.

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:35.700
This... This is nothing.

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:41.380
"Heki: One of Ei Sei's 
 inner circle"

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:42.000
Just as I thought--you're champing at the bit.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.830
I knew it was worth
coming all this way to see you.

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:49.410
Now that you mention it...
What are you doing out here?

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:52.080
I'm on my way to my post at Asui Castle.

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:58.750
Shin, the results of the
Chin-Sho alliance are coming to light.

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:04.160
Our Gi strategy!

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:06.410
Since we don't have to be wary of Sho anymore,

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:10.450
we can focus our military power on Gi.

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:16.200
So Kanyou's formed a grand strategy:
send troops into Sanyou in Gi

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:20.620
to take the region's
twenty castles in one fell swoop.

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:25.790
Th-That's one hell of a war...

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:30.290
This is still highly confidential,

00:07:30.290 --> 00:07:35.200
but I came here to tell you anyway, Shin.

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:37.450
If you want to climb the ranks,

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:41.120
your best bet is to win big
in a huge battle like this one.

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:46.830
But first you have to be placed
in a crucial position within the army.

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:48.200
Why?

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:51.540
You can't expect great results
when you're at the edges of the battlefield

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:53.540
for logistical support.

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:55.870
Makes sense.

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:59.290
So this is no time to be disheartened, Shin.

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:06.120
The Gi offensive will likely
get started within a year.

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:10.080
Until then, keep chalking up
win after win, no matter how small,

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:13.000
and get yourself
into a better position for the real fight!

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:19.290
This info's already been leaked
to the powerful military commanders...

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:22.790
You can tell by all the ambitious
men gathering at the front lines,

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:26.000
ready to put what I've said into practice.

00:08:28.910 --> 00:08:34.160
Well, sure. We're not
the only ones shootin' for the stars.

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:37.580
But that doesn't mean we're gonna lose to them!

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:40.950
Go get 'em, Shin.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:47.660
Thanks for comin' out here to tell me all this.

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:50.450
I always could count on you, my man Heki.

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:55.660
Don't thank me. You're like a
little brother I have to keep my eye on.

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:07.910
Give me some intel on the units in this area.

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:10.540
Their scale, achievements--anything will do.

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:11.540
Sir!

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:16.000
Maybe that was a little meddling of me...

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:22.120
Some days later, an unusually large
battle was unfolding on the front lines

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:25.290
where Shin and his troops found themselves.

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:27.700
The Gi army had
mustered from throughout the area

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:32.660
to push back the front lines,
and were now more than ten thousand strong.

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:36.620
The Chin army mustered their troops
to the north and south,

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:40.000
intending to attack Gi from both sides.

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:43.910
It was the first midsized battle
in this part of the kingdom.

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:49.000
Here we go, Commander.
Ten thousand troops on both sides.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:51.700
No sittin' this one out, eh, Shin?

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:52.950
Right.

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:56.370
The Hi Shin Unit is gonna stay
an independent reserve squadron.

00:09:56.370 --> 00:10:00.790
We can go where we want during
the battle, but don't count on any other help.

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:02.330
We watch for the perfect opportunity

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:05.000
and go for their general--on our strength alone!

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:10.200
Kyou Kai, what's your take?

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:16.040
The Chin army will likely make it
to the main force before reaching stalemate.

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:17.910
If you want their general,

00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:19.910
start back here,

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:22.830
circle around behind their
main force, then rush them.

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:27.450
Of course, it won't be easy
to break through their defenses.

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:32.750
En, Ro En?

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:33.950
No objections.

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:35.370
Same here.

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:37.370
Okay... Let's do this!

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:45.250
Push! Push!

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:46.620
Push on in!

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:50.910
I-It's no use! We can't reach Gi's main force!

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:53.750
We're losing soldiers on our side instead!

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:55.250
If this keeps up--

00:10:58.410 --> 00:10:59.830
What's that squadron over there?

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:04.120
They're dodging the defensive formation
and circling behind the enemy's main force!

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:06.000
Th-That's...

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:11.160
...the Hi Shin Unit!

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:13.250
We're breakin' through!

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:20.040
Wh-What's with these guys?!

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:22.000
S-Such might!

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:25.040
Hey! What are you doing?!
Don't let them through!

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:28.580
If they get past us,
the main force'll be totally expo--

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:36.000
Here we go!

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:39.040
Your general is gonna be

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:40.250
history!

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:46.000
"Shin"

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:49.950
What?!

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:54.410
Still <i>nothing</i> between you and His Highness?

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:57.040
Uh-huh...

00:11:57.040 --> 00:12:02.540
I go to his bedchamber, but he always
tells me to just sit quietly beside him.

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:07.450
B-But Kou... His Highness has
summoned you time and time again!

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:10.330
Usually people don't
get called more than once...

00:12:12.200 --> 00:12:14.080
Wh-What is it?

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:21.000
I don't <i>see</i> anything special about you...

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:23.080
...so why you?

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:25.540
I-I have no idea!

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:28.580
That girl bolts at the most suspicious times.

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:30.120
Kou, wait!

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:32.200
Let me get a better look at you!

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:35.040
Stop it, You! I said I don't know!

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:35.040
C'mon, Kou, get back here!

00:12:38.330 --> 00:12:42.000
So Gi has made it to our borders again.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:43.290
Yes.

00:12:43.290 --> 00:12:48.080
There have been ongoing skirmishes
at the front line for days now.

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:51.410
We must make haste with the Gi offensive.

00:12:57.620 --> 00:12:59.620
Five years...

00:12:59.620 --> 00:13:00.830
Sire?

00:13:02.950 --> 00:13:05.750
Keep climbing, and fast...

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:09.330
I'm waiting for you, Shin.

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:23.290
Go, go, go! Keep up with your commander!

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:36.790
Yesss! We're through!

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:39.040
Take their general!

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:49.290
What <i>is</i> all this?!

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:53.950
Th-They've all been killed...

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:57.330
The main force--obliterated?!

00:13:57.330 --> 00:13:59.580
What's going on?

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:05.040
What's this? Someone's here...

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:21.830
Well, well! What have we here?

00:14:21.830 --> 00:14:25.910
So we weren't the only ones
after the main force.

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:28.910
Unfortunately, you're a little too late.

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:34.080
So they got to the enemy general before we did?!

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:41.620
Who <i>is</i> this guy?

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:49.660
A h-horseman squad?

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:52.200
You there! Foot soldiers!

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:54.000
Whose squad are you?

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:58.330
W-We belong to Chin's northern army!

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.870
We're the special 300-man Hi Shin Unit!

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:02.410
And you?

00:15:03.830 --> 00:15:05.870
What?!

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:07.540
The Hi Shin Unit?

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:12.790
Wh-Whose squad are you?

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:18.750
What gives? Identify yourselves!

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:21.080
We are the Gyoku Hou Force,

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:24.700
the special 300-man squadron
in Chin's southern army.

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:27.230
"Gyoku Hou Force"

00:15:29.160 --> 00:15:31.540
A special 300-man squadron?

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:34.500
Just like us?!

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:38.450
I see. So you're that Hi Shin Unit...

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:45.290
Huh?

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:56.330
What's so funny, you jerks?!

00:15:56.330 --> 00:16:01.830
Apologies. Forgive our rudeness.
But you see, I can explain.

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:05.250
We hear so much of the Hi Shin Unit these days.

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:12.120
Being a fellow special force,
we've been on the lookout for them.

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:14.080
But to learn that the rumors were right,

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:18.660
and you really <i>are</i> a bunch of country soldiers?

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:22.000
Why, we could hardly believe our eyes.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:23.450
Forgive us.

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:34.000
Quit laughin'!

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:38.330
So what if we're country soldiers, huh?!

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:42.250
We're 300 men strong, same as you!

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:45.700
We are <i>far</i> from the same, you imbecile.

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:47.620
Say what?!

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:51.160
The Gyoku Hou Force is
an elite squadron made up of noblemen

00:16:51.160 --> 00:16:55.370
educated in military school from a young age.

00:16:55.370 --> 00:17:00.950
We wield swords and swing spears
long before any farm child grips a hoe,

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:04.580
and have both individual
and group combat drummed into us.

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:09.910
Whereas <i>you</i> are novices at war,
meant to be working the fields.

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:14.160
I see why you'd be so happy
to pull off a string of victories and all,

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:17.370
but the idea that your squadron
is on a par with ours makes me ill.

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:24.660
Just having you foot soldiers
in a special squad in the first place

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:26.830
is a big mistake.

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:32.370
Your presence on the battlefield
is most appropriately

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:35.250
like that of an ant.

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:36.750
An ant?!

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:39.950
Ants faithfully carry out orders from above,

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:43.080
regardless of their own self-interest.

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:48.250
Devoting yourselves to this
is the most crucial duty for you foot soldiers.

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:51.580
Not to belittle you, of course.

00:17:51.580 --> 00:17:54.450
When forming an army of over 100 thousand,

00:17:54.450 --> 00:17:57.200
a good eighty percent
consists of foot soldiers like you.

00:17:57.200 --> 00:18:02.290
You are the fundamental power of any army,
and without you, we cannot fight.

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:06.000
Still, ants are ants.

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:09.870
Leave the high-level
independent-reserve work to us.

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:13.040
You go back to your post and work hard.

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:18.250
Harboring dreams above your station
never works out in the end.

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:22.750
Though I can see some fool
putting you up to this.

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:31.540
I knew it...

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:34.870
Mention the Gi offensive

00:18:34.870 --> 00:18:38.540
and little squads start
showing up from everywhere.

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:41.330
Including the Gyoku Hou Force

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:44.910
and <i>that</i> 300-man squadron
already made it through.

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:47.540
But that commander of theirs...

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:52.750
Hang in there, Shin.

00:18:54.790 --> 00:19:00.080
Shall we? We must take the
general's head and put an end to this battle.

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:01.080
Yes.

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:04.040
Not so fast!

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:10.790
S-Shin! Easy there! You're talking to a noble--

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:12.080
Enough!

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:16.290
What the hell have I been
listenin' to all this time, huh?!

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:22.160
Noble or not doesn't matter one bit
once the fightin' starts, you moron!

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:28.120
These hands of ours've
killed high-falutin' guys just like you!

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:29.950
Who's the moron here?

00:19:29.950 --> 00:19:32.660
Did you not understand my story about the ants?

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:36.750
Lieutenant Ban You!

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:37.750
Sir!

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:52.040
Wh-What the--

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:57.250
Troops! Atten- <i>shun</i> !

00:20:11.330 --> 00:20:14.580
There we go! <i>Now</i> do you understand?

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:20.040
Bastard!

00:20:20.040 --> 00:20:21.040
Don't.

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:31.370
That does it.

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:35.540
Get down off your horse
right now, gramps, and apologize.

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:38.660
Unless you want me to drag you off.

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:41.620
Oho! With that toy sword of yours?

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:52.080
Why, you...

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:54.410
Shin!

00:20:58.000 --> 00:21:01.700
Incidentally, I'd like to give
some candid advice to you in particular:

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:08.450
I hear you started out as a servant,
and now brag about becoming a general.

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:10.450
Right now, among the nobility,

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:14.950
talented young commanders
like me are coming to the fore.

00:21:14.950 --> 00:21:20.660
The battle to be the next general
has already begun,

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:26.450
but there's not even a speck of room
in there for a roadside weed like you.

00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:29.120
At best, you'll command
no more than a thousand men.

00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:44.450
S-Sh--

00:21:45.540 --> 00:21:47.620
No--It's a reverse thrust.

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:53.580
Shin!

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:55.080
Shin!

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:59.500
Why bother using
the Dragon Finger on the likes of him?

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:00.540
Dragon Finger?

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:05.750
A piercing technique:
tracing weaving orbits in mid-air, like a dragon.

00:22:05.750 --> 00:22:08.160
This guy... He's tough.

00:22:09.540 --> 00:22:13.040
Honestly, you've been
a thorn in our side for a while now.

00:22:13.040 --> 00:22:16.620
Now's the time to make
the crucial gap between us

00:22:16.620 --> 00:22:19.750
absolutely crystal clear.

00:22:22.160 --> 00:22:24.160
Y-You bastard...

00:22:24.160 --> 00:22:27.540
Remember this, commander of the Hi Shin Unit:

00:22:27.540 --> 00:22:29.290
My name is Ou Hon.

00:22:29.290 --> 00:22:31.370
Ou Hon...

00:22:31.370 --> 00:22:33.410
Ou...?

00:22:33.410 --> 00:22:35.620
Ou?!

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:40.250
Yes. Of the same clan as your beloved Ou Ki.

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:42.330
Unlike Ou Ki, from a mere branch,

00:22:42.330 --> 00:22:46.200
<i>this</i> Ou carries on the main family's name!

00:22:46.050 --> 00:22:48.790
"Ou Hon: Commander, Gyoku Hou Force"
"Chin Army Special 300-Man Squadron"

00:22:52.500 --> 00:22:55.830
We'll stay on this front line for a while yet.

00:22:55.830 --> 00:22:59.410
You'd better get used to disappointment.

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:51.750
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:54.830
<i>Why would the voice that melted into the sky</i>

00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:59.450
<i>Peel away and disappear?</i>

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:03.790
<i>Just a single word</i>

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:06.830
<i>If that's all you'd say</i>

00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:11.700
<i>What kind of word would you choose?</i>

00:24:12.540 --> 00:24:15.910
<i>Holding my breath and making sure</i>

00:24:15.910 --> 00:24:18.870
<i>The heartbeat can't wait</i>

00:24:18.870 --> 00:24:24.830
<i>If I let go of your hand, I'll want even more</i>

00:24:24.830 --> 00:24:28.450
<i>And so I keep on doing this</i>

00:24:28.450 --> 00:24:30.910
<i>Not allowing myself to stop</i>

00:24:30.910 --> 00:24:35.700
<i>Because I'm still searching for answers</i>

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:39.370
<i>I want you to tell me</i>

00:24:41.700 --> 00:24:46.200
<i>Before you melt away into the sky</i>

00:24:52.000 --> 00:24:58.010
"Next Episode Preview"

00:25:02.000 --> 00:25:07.020
"The Third Force"
